openaiClient.setup:
In ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json (the global one), add a provider:
"provider": { "agent-spaghetti": { "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible", "name": "Agent Spaghetti", "options": { "baseURL": "{url}", "apiKey": "{key}" }, "models": { "auto": { "name": "Agent Spaghetti (auto)" } } } }
Then pick agent-spaghetti/auto as the model in OpenCode. Which LLM answers is chosen in Agent Spaghetti (Tools → OpenCode → Model).
